---
const MYFXBOOK_URL = 'https://www.myfxbook.com/members/BrownArmadillo/brown-armadillo/12140477';
---

<section id="track-record" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink py-28">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20">
    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1611974789855-9c2a0a7236a3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=80"
      alt=""
      class="h-full w-full object-cover"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-ink via-ink/95 to-ink"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold">
        Transparency From Day One
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-balance font-display text-4xl font-medium leading-tight text-paper sm:text-5xl">
        Every trade, published since inception
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-balance text-lg leading-relaxed text-ash">
        Our fund launched in November 2025. Rather than share curated highlights, we
        publish results for every single trade, in real time, on an independent
        third-party platform, so you can verify our performance for yourself.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mx-auto mt-14 max-w-4xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gold/30 bg-panel">
      <div class="grid gap-0 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="border-b border-white/10 p-8 text-center sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r">
          <p class="font-display text-3xl text-gold">Nov 2025</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ash-2">Fund inception</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-white/10 p-8 text-center sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r">
          <p class="font-display text-3xl text-gold">100%</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ash-2">Of trades reported</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 text-center">
          <p class="font-display text-3xl text-gold">3rd-Party</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ash-2">Independently verified</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border-t border-white/10 bg-ink-2 p-8 text-center sm:p-10">
        <p class="text-sm text-ash">
          Live, up-to-the-minute performance, including growth, drawdown and every
          individual trade, is hosted on myfxbook, an independent trade-verification
          platform used across the industry.
        </p>
        <a
          href={MYFXBOOK_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gold px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] hover:bg-gold-light"
        >
          View Our Live Track Record on myfxbook
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-ash-2">
          Figures update live on myfxbook. Past performance is not a guarantee of
          future results.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
